,"content":[{"text":"Yehowa aŋlɔ ɖe dukɔwo ƒe agbalẽ me be,","poem":1},{"text":"“Wodzi esia le Zion.” Sela","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Ne wole ha dzim la, woadzi ha be,","poem":1},{"text":"“Nye agunuwo katã le mewò.”","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}